The **Classic** theme is Buttondown's traditional archive theme: a clean, simple list layout that puts your writing front and center. It's the best fit for text-focused newsletters where the reading experience matters more than imagery.

- [Live preview](https://buttondown.com/el-classico/archive/who-was-telemachus-anyway/)
- [Source CSS](https://github.com/buttondown/themes/blob/main/themes/classic/assets/styles.css)

You can switch to the Classic theme—and tweak any of the settings below—from your [archive settings](https://buttondown.com/settings/archives).

